      "current_tex": "\\begin{proposition}[Supremum in the Set Is the Maximum]\n\\label{prop:supremum-in-the-set-is-the-maximum}\nLet $A\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}$ be nonempty and bounded above, and let\n$s=\\sup A$. If $s\\in A$, then\n\\[\n  s=\\max A.\n\\]\n\n\\hyperref[prf:supremum-in-the-set-is-the-maximum]{Go to proof.}\n\\end{proposition}",
